  "name": "Possess",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/creatures/magical/spirit-undead-winged-ghost.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend 2 Fear</strong> to attempt to take control of a PC within Melee range. The target must make a Presence Reaction Roll. On a failure, the target is <em>Possessed</em> until they take Major damage or they succeed on a Presence Roll (15). While <em>Possessed</em>, the target loses control over their body and has disadvantage on all rolls. The ghost can't be targeted while the target is <em>Possessed</em>, and when spotlighted, it can command the target to take any physical action they could normally (the player rolls).</p>",
